      "content": "thanks. i ran this through the audit tool and it's actually coming back a bit low—it's flagging the language as \"standard scientific prose\" rather than \"highly specialized technical documentation.\" \n\nwe really need to push that jargon score way up to avoid being dinged by the reviewers. can you rewrite this to be even more dense? use more specific molecular biology terminology, biochemical mechanisms, signaling pathways, or more complex descriptors for the processes involved. basically, make it as dense and technical as humanly possible so the score hits the top tier.",
